Z||000014||jmw||01-24-2001||02:51 PM||||To be honest, I wouldn't WANT the type of attention FieroLisa gets. In fact, I'm a little creeped out by it sometimes because you all are so "sexual" with her. She's a KID guys (no offense, Lisa). It's not only inappropriate but could be DANGEROUS for her. Men are supposed to PROTECT women - not PREY on them (sorry but I have issues with this stuff). Plus, it is just TOO EASY nowadays for people to find out where you live, etc. And until you meet them (like Hoop said) you don't REALLY know who you're talking to...<BR>I just say be careful.<P>In all honesty, though, I am sort of frustrated by the fact that a lof of guys in my age group (35-40) want women in their 20s. They don't want a partner, they want a playmate! Either that or they have TONS of baggage. It seems like SO many people's values are screwed up - women's as WELL as men's. I mean, really, if you have a good relationship you should count yourself lucky 'cause they seem to be few and far between.<P>That's all. Hope I haven't offended anyone but last time I checked we were all entitled to an opinion.||||reg||4
